Description: Unbound desktop environment
 The Unbound desktop: a pure Wayland desktop with its own compositor, shell,
 session services and applications. Installing this package adds "Unbound"
 to the sessions a display manager such as GDM, SDDM or greetd offers.
 .
 It recommends a browser, text editor, image viewer, PDF viewer, calculator
 and video player, and opens files in them by default, and an unlocked
 keyring for the passwords browsers and editors keep.

Package: unbound-dock
Architecture: all
Section: oldlibs
Depends: unbound-bar (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: transitional package for unbound-bar
 The Unbound Dock is now drawn by unbound-bar, which hosts the Dock and the
 menu bar in one process. This package can be removed safely.

Package: unbound-menubar
Architecture: all
Section: oldlibs
Depends: unbound-bar (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: transitional package for unbound-bar
 The Unbound menu bar is now drawn by unbound-bar, which hosts the Dock and
 the menu bar in one process. This package can be removed safely.
